            "SPR Analysis": "Using the surface plasmon resonance (SPR) method it was shown that DIDS binds directly to RAD51 with Kd = 2 μM. It was suggested that DIDS binds to a RAD51 region close to the DNA binding site(s), and directly competes with DNA for RAD51 binding. To test this hypothesis it would be important to solve the structure of the RAD51-DIDS complex."
        },
